{"id":1,"date":"2019-01-27T03:39:15","date_gmt":"2019-01-27T03:39:15","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/innostation.cn\/?p=1"},"modified":"2019-03-25T05:57:21","modified_gmt":"2019-03-25T05:57:21","slug":"hello-world","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/innostation.cn\/2019\/01\/27\/hello-world\/","title":{"rendered":"InnoStation by EU Sino &#8211; soft-landing zone of ENRICH"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>On June 22<\/strong><strong><sup>nd<\/sup><\/strong><strong>,<\/strong><strong>&nbsp;2018<\/strong><strong>&nbsp;the European Network of Research and Innovation Centres and Hubs (ENRICH) officially certified EU Sino as<\/strong><strong>&nbsp;one of<\/strong><strong>&nbsp;its<\/strong><strong>&nbsp;new<\/strong><strong>&nbsp;Soft-Landing Zone<\/strong><strong>s. <\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/innostation.cn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/EU-Sino-Enrich-Frederic.jpg?resize=512%2C342&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-312\" width=\"512\" height=\"342\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/innostation.cn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/EU-Sino-Enrich-Frederic.jpg?resize=1024%2C683&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/innostation.cn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/EU-Sino-Enrich-Frederic.jpg?resize=300%2C200&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/innostation.cn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/EU-Sino-Enrich-Frederic.jpg?resize=768%2C512&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/innostation.cn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/EU-Sino-Enrich-Frederic.jpg?resize=930%2C620&amp;ssl=1 930w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/innostation.cn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/EU-Sino-Enrich-Frederic.jpg?w=1500&amp;ssl=1 1500w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/innostation.cn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/03\/EU-Sino-Enrich-Frederic.jpg?w=2250&amp;ssl=1 2250w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The Soft-Landing Zone status\u00a0shows that EU Sino is a qualified organization\u00a0capable of aiding\u00a0STI\u00a0\u2013 related (Science Technology Innovation) businesses\u00a0to land in China. This\u00a0is the beginning of\u00a0a lasting\u00a0cooperation between ENRICH and EU Sino.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\"><figure class=\"alignleft is-resized\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/innostation.cn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/EnriCh_China_ScienceTechnologyInnovation_SoftlandingZone_540sq.jpg?resize=270%2C270&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-222\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/innostation.cn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/EnriCh_China_ScienceTechnologyInnovation_SoftlandingZone_540sq.jpg?w=540&amp;ssl=1 540w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/innostation.cn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/EnriCh_China_ScienceTechnologyInnovation_SoftlandingZone_540sq.jpg?resize=150%2C150&amp;ssl=1 150w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/innostation.cn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2019\/01\/EnriCh_China_ScienceTechnologyInnovation_SoftlandingZone_540sq.jpg?resize=300%2C300&amp;ssl=1 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 270px) 100vw, 270px\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">ENRICH is a global network of centres and hubs that supports the internationalization of European science, technology and innovation. Promoted by the European Commission through Horizon 2020, the ENRICH network currently offers services to connect European research, technology and business organizations with three global front-runner innovation markets: Brazil, China and the US.\u00a0(<a href=\"http:\/\/www.enrichcentres.eu\/\">www.enrichcentres.eu<\/a>)like when we became the first SLZ of Enrich in China.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Soft-Landing Zone provides a packaged landing service: from localization guidance, administrative support, to advice on laws and regulations affecting RDI \u2013 related activities (Research Development&nbsp;Innovation).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For our 2<sup>nd<\/sup>\u00a0round table in June in Shanghai, with the topic of\u00a0\u2018how companies select their operational sites\u2019, EU Sino collaborated with ENRICH.\u00a0Once more ENRICH,\u00a0was our partner\u00a0for our 3rd round table\u00a0event this year: <strong>September 7<sup>th<\/sup><\/strong><strong>\u00a0in Shenzhen<\/strong>. This event focused\u00a0on how Shenzhen has integrated innovation into its industries. (<a href=\"http:\/\/www.eusinobc.com\/events\/\">www.eusinobc.com\/events\/<\/a>) <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">ENRICH has \u00a0a network of 11 Soft-Landing Zones\u00a0in China.\u00a0Currently among the first certified Landing-Zones, EU Sino, is\u00a0recognized as the key service provider to European\u00a0companies planning to land\u00a0in Suzhou.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you want to know more about these topics or EU Sino, please do not hesitate to\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.eusinobc.com\/contact-us\/\">contact us<\/a>.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>On June 22nd,&nbsp;2018&nbsp;the European Network of Research and Innovation Centres and Hubs (ENRICH) officially certified EU Sino as&nbsp;one of&nbsp;its&nbsp;new&nbsp;Soft-Landing Zones. The Soft-Landing Zone status\u00a0shows that EU Sino is a qualified organization\u00a0capable of aiding\u00a0STI\u00a0\u2013 related (Science Technology Innovation) businesses\u00a0to land in China. This\u00a0is the beginning of\u00a0a lasting\u00a0cooperation between ENRICH and EU Sino. ENRICH is a global&hellip;&nbsp;<a href=\"https:\/\/innostation.cn\/2019\/01\/27\/hello-world\/\" class=\"\" rel=\"bookmark\">Read More &raquo;<span class=\"screen-reader-text\">InnoStation by EU Sino &#8211; soft-landing zone of ENRICH<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"templa